     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Cohesion and references",
     "texto": [
      "Organise the complaint: context, facts, evidence and request. Use pronouns with a clear referent and connectors such as **derfor** («therefore», consequence) and **likevel** («even so», contrast). A deadline should only be requested or cited if it has been set."
     ],
